        "text_intro": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Make our Nobu-style Miso-Glazed King Salmon Bento Box — a 48-hour saké and miso marinade that caramelizes deeply under the broiler, then holds beautifully warm or at room temperature, making it one of our favorite proteins for meal prep. Built on clean, regenerative, sushi-grade seafood tested to the <a href=\"/pages/why-clean-seafood-matters\" title=\"Why Clean Seafood Matters\">Seatopia Standard™</a>. Seatopia King Salmon comes from <a href=\"/pages/mt-cook-alpine-salmon\" title=\"Mt. Cook Alpine King Salmon\">Mt. Cook Alpine Salmon</a>, raised in the glacial-fed freshwater canals of New Zealand's Southern Alps. Grown without antibiotics or hormones in constantly flowing alpine water, this King Salmon is prized for its exceptionally high omega-3 content, buttery marbling, and silken texture — equally at home served raw as sashimi or broiled to a golden, umami-rich glaze.</p>",
            "text_size": "subtext-md",
            "text_max_size": 32,
            "text_font": "body",
            "secondary_color": false,
            "highlighted_text": "none",
